  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The interventions have two overall objectives; 1) to promote effective national institutions and process structures for the promotion, protection and implementation of human rights; and 2) to promote public participation as an indispensable element in the development of democracy and fulfillment of human rights, including the promotion of dialogue, based on nationally owned and evidence based facts as an effective means of promoting democratic structures, rule of law and human rights.</narrative>
